# Packages of the riscv64 Kitten build-env images, installed from a local repo of
# the dnf-bridge layer's RPMs (build-env.bb do_layer_repo).  One name per line.
# Taken from the 9.0-bootstrap image built on 2026-11-20 from the live Kitten
# repos (rpm -qa, minus gpg-pubkey): the set the Dockerfile ended up with, so
# the layer build installs the same packages at the layer's versions.  When
